{"ref":"BDB, גְּוִיָּה","hw":"גְּוִיָּה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. body, corpse</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:3\" href=\"/Nahum.3.3\">Na 3:3</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:8\" href=\"/Judges.14.8\">Ju 14:8</a> + 2 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיָּתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 31:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.31.10\">1 S 31:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:6\" href=\"/Daniel.10.6\">Dn 10:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיָּתֵנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:18\" href=\"/Genesis.47.18\">Gn 47:18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיָּתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:3\" href=\"/Nahum.3.3\">Na 3:3</a>; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 110:6\" href=\"/Psalms.110.6\">ψ 110:6</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיֹּתֵנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:37\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.37\">Ne 9:37</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיֹּתֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.23\">Ez 1:23</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּוִיֹּתֵיהֶ֑נָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.11\">11</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  living human <em>body</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:18\" href=\"/Genesis.47.18\">Gn 47:18</a> (sg., of many persons) cf. pl. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:37\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.37\">Ne 9:37</a>; of man in Daniel’s vision <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:6\" href=\"/Daniel.10.6\">Dn 10:6</a> (body apart from extremities); also of the living creatures in Ezek.’s vision <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.11\">Ez 1:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.23\">23</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>dead body, corpse, carcass:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  of man <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 31:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.31.10\">1 S 31:10</a> (so orig. in ‖ <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.10\">1 Ch 10:10</a> v. We<sup>Sm</sup> cf. Dr) v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.12\">12</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (sg. of several persons), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 110:6\" href=\"/Psalms.110.6\">ψ 110:6</a>; coll. <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:3\" href=\"/Nahum.3.3\">Na 3:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <strong>b.</strong>  of lion <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:8\" href=\"/Judges.14.8\">Ju 14:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:9\" href=\"/Judges.14.9\">9</a>.","next":"BDB, גּוֹי","prev":"BDB, גֵּוָה³"}